# Cloudflare Pages Redirects
# Note: Cloudflare Pages natively serves /<page>.html cleanly at /<page> without 200 rewrites.
# Defining /foo /foo.html 200 causes 308 self-redirects on Pages; only define alias redirects here.

/faqs /faq 301
/guides /articles 301
/disclaimer /terms 301
/security /.well-known/security.txt 301
